  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"立即在 ServerAtelier 獲取您的預算遊戲伺服器\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xR4YM0ND/RAYs-3D-Rails/main/gallery/rays_3d_rails_title_wide.png\" alt=\"rays 3d rails 標題橫幅\"></p><p>此資源包更改了 Minecraft 中鐵軌的方塊與物品材質。<br>\n自 3.0 版本起支援光影效果。</p><p>它本身不添加任何物品或方塊，而是覆蓋以下列出的模組及原版中現有鐵軌的模型。</p><h2>支援的模組：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania (Fabric/Quilt)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopperrails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Rails</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/little-logistics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Logistics</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modernminecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Minecarts</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Minecarts and Rails</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rail-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Rail Variants (MStV+)</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oxidized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oxidized</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-locomotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Locomotion</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-railroads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Useful Railroads</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fRail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla</a> <code>// 4 種變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xannoszs-better-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xannosz's Better Minecarts</a> <code>// 1 種變體</code></li>\n</ul><p>如果您希望支援其他模組，請告訴我。</p><h2>連結</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/RAYs-3D-Rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source_code-lightgray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=555555\" alt=\"原始碼徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/WXdSYn4yHB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=555555&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 徽章\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frays-3d-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/jKa9Ievs?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=555555&amp;color=1BD964\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載量徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/861245?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=555555&amp;color=FF8041\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載量徽章\"></a></p>",
